        <item>
            <title>0.10.0</title>
            <pubDate>Tue, 11 Aug 2026 11:25:08 +0700</pubDate>
            <sparkle:version>0.10.0</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>0.10.0</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>26.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
            <description><![CDATA[<h2>What's new in 0.10.0</h2>
<ul>
<li>The menu and its folders now behave identically everywhere. Every gesture — hovering, flicking, arranging, the pill that stays lit after a slow swipe — runs on one shared rulebook for both rings, so a folder can never react differently than the main menu again</li>
<li>The first interaction after opening is instant: the graphics warm up in the background at launch, removing the slow first hover</li>
<li>Arrange mode feels tighter: all wiggling pills rock in sync, the pill you grab always rides above everything else, and a linked pair&#x27;s grey link mark stays glued to its pair through every drag and swap</li>
<li>Moving a lit pill&#x27;s selection to another pill now needs actual contact with the new pill — fast sweeps past other pills no longer steal the selection</li>
<li>The arrows inside folders now give the same hover sound as everything else</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
